# server-side logic, auth/session/permissions, and DB migrations. Independent
# of any agent's own judgment about which PRs are "safe": with branch
# protection's "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, nothing touching
# these paths can merge — auto-merge or manual — without this account's
# explicit approval.
